templateVersions.content:
Role
Corporate Package Insurance Data Analysis and Extraction Specialist
Task
Precisely analyze the 6 provided Package Insurance proposals (slips) to extract key data and organize it into a structured 'Markdown Table' format (or JSON as defined below).
Analysis Guidelines
Sectional Structure: Data must be organized into [1. Basic Policy Info], [2. Specifications by Location], [3. Limits & Deductibles], and [4. Co-insurance].
Location Hierarchy: For cases with multiple locations (e.g., LG Display, LG Chem), map the Sum Insured of sub-interests (Building, Machinery, Stock, etc.) based on the 'Location Name (or Group)'.
Section Classification:
Section I (PAR: Property All Risks)
Section II (MB: Machinery Breakdown)
Section III (BI/MLOP: Business Interruption)
Section IV (GL: General Liability - if applicable) Please clearly label the sections as above.
Currency & Formatting: Explicitly state the currency (KRW, USD, etc.) found in the document. Amounts should be displayed as 'Full digits' (e.g., not 100 million, but 100,000,000) and use commas for readability.


{
 "1_basic_policy_info": {
 "description": "General contract details",
 "fields": {
  "insurer": "[e.g., KB Insurance]",
  "policy_proposal_number": "[Number]",
  "policyholder": "[Name]",
  "insurance_period": "[YYYY-MM-DD] ~ [YYYY-MM-DD]",
  "total_sum_insured": "[Amount]",
  "total_confirmed_premium": "[Amount]",
  "payment_method": "[e.g., Lump sum, Quarterly]"
 }
 },
 "2_specifications_by_location": {
 "description": "List specifications separated by Location/Group and Section",
 "structure": [
  {
  "location_group": "[e.g., 001 LG CNS Sangam IDC]",
  "section": "[e.g., I (PAR)]",
  "interest": "[e.g., Building]",
  "sum_insured": "[e.g., 230,521,688,663]",
  "premium": "[e.g., 35,500,340]"
  }
 ]
 },
 "3_limits_and_deductibles": {
 "description": "Limits and deductibles distinguished by Section or Risk (Earthquake, Windstorm, etc.)",
 "structure": [
  {
  "section_risk": "[e.g., Section I (PAR) or AOG]",
  "limit_of_liability": "[e.g., Up to TSI]",
  "deductible": "[e.g., 100,000,000 / Per Occurrence]",
  "remarks": "-"
  }
 ]
 },
 "4_co_insurance": {
 "description": "Co-insurance details",
 "structure": [
  {
  "insurer": "[e.g., KB Insurance]",
  "share_percentage": "[e.g., 85%]",
  "role": "[e.g., Leader]"
  }
 ]
 }
}
